{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：11:07 2026-07-07 HKT</p>\n<p>天文台於今晨（7日）5時30分發出黃色暴雨警告，受大雨影響，新界北部包括元朗八鄉及錦田、上水、打鼓嶺一帶出現水浸。在打鼓嶺李屋村，所見入村的村路嚴重水浸，村民涉水而行，水深高至小腿位，相當狼狽。途經的車輛亦被淹浸幾近半個車輪，行駛時都小心翼翼，避免死火。</p>\n<p>現場消息稱，由於村路水浸，私家車司機都不敢駕車入村，只有重型車輛可以勉強涉水而行。至早上10時許，渠務署派員到場處理，清理淤塞渠口疏導水浸。</p>\n<img alt=\"打鼓嶺李屋村一帶出現水浸。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4d82a5a09afeace28d0af3b2c21cfe52/2026-07/1_1_3.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"村路受阻。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/fbf2d3cdf4ea7fd7cd395045040309f0/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_28_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a2472d5c6586b0e2444bc1ab6cb91041/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_31.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"重型車輛涉水而行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6a94735844f32cb7c8f1d401edc308ba/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_30.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"水深至小腿位置，途人為之卻步。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c4c66b8a75e3b9531a8bc48617bde0d6/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_30_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/2ccc43410c607407ec9685ede543ad70/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_31_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"車輛小心翼翼行駛避免死火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f97e7f9472dd80afc4b38450534d8b06/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a5fa6680629a0e6eb10528f7c8ecb11a/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/f07738c7bcf942e820e0120e18e500d4/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/e817371faad413a1d35730709ebf8364/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_33.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/720d4b83d69e5f33d347f496e1be532e/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_19_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/eafdba46a5ec716521aef04c93653835/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_35_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/eaf45cd9e2e5b1c19d5ff497dd8755f1/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_34_20.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/c9c43fa17e60a2198458a54dc01803d3/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_38.jpeg\"/>\n<p>另外在沙頭角五洲路，有村民表示今晨大雨期間，曾經水浸超過一呎高，惟至早上10時許，水浸情況已退卻。</p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/331ebaf23ee5549462ebb4116f754277/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_30_37.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/a809f6efa203be311ef566a49e6ce11b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_34.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/27025893805b3d003b6252fbca940e6b/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_35_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/becf03acd159e1349fbe89cfa284daf5/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_35.jpeg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/4b1a8f7e97e62e5a4ad0686c6d450d40/2026-07/WhatsApp_Image_2026-07-07_at_10_11_36.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-07T05:19:36.839896+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":274,"images":19,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}